OL,3,GNEWSAFootball game abandoned after
OL,4,Aplayers 'assaulted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur football match was abandoned
OL,7,Fafter about 20 minutes as two players
OL,8,Fwere "assaulted" by the opposition in a
OL,9,F"completely unprovoked attack", a club
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,FMidhurst and Easebourne FC said its
OL,13,Fcommunity team's fixture at home
OL,14,Fagainst Emsworth Town in a memorial cup
OL,15,Fon Saturday afternoon was called off
OL,16,Fafter the incident, with one player
OL,17,Fneeding hospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
