OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFootball game abandoned after
OL,4,Aplayers 'assaulted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club said the player had been
OL,7,Fdischarged but had "severe damage" to
OL,8,Fthe inside of his mouth, a broken bone
OL,9,Fin his jaw and "a high chance of
OL,10,Frequiring surgery to fix the injury
OL,11,Ffurther".
OL,13,FSussex Police says it is investigating
OL,14,Fand "no arrests have been made at this
OL,15,Ftime", while Emsworth Town has been
OL,16,Fcontacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
